# Orynelo repository guidance

Read and follow [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) at the repository root before
working. It contains the shared instructions for all coding agents.
Use [docs/agents/README.md](../../docs/agents/README.md) to find the project
map, development workflow, and guardrails relevant to the task.

Preserve the shared Go application layer, bounded diagnostic work, privacy
projection, report compatibility, and Fyne UI-thread lifecycle.
Keep changes within the active task. An explicit instruction to skip checks
also excludes tests, linters, builds, and post-edit inspection commands.
Maintain detailed guidance in the shared files, not in this adapter.
